{
 "label": "daily-unwrap-sum-without-loki-defaults",
 "date": "2026-11-03",
 "set": "unwrap-sum-without",
 "description": "`sum without` over a range function with unwrap (PR for semantics/unwrap-sum-without-collapses): Loki keeps a series per remaining label set; the last stats pipe had no grouping and VictoriaLogs answered one row, so the proxy answered one series. W1-W4 are range queries over a logfmt stream group (max_over_time, sum_over_time, rate, max without), parsed with `| logfmt amount` so a Loki series is the stream (a bare `| logfmt` makes every payment line a series of its own on Loki: thousands of series, and Loki cannot answer within the timeout; semantics/unwrap-per-series-identity-raw-rows), W5-W6 are instant, W7 wraps the aggregation in topk, W8 counts a stream-label function whose series limit now applies to the folded answer (its selector leaves out the OTel-instrumented streams and the otel-collector: Loki carries their structured metadata, trace_id and span_id, in the series, so under a `without` every OTel line is a series of its own and Loki did not answer W8 within the timeout), W9 is the label_replace instant control that must not move. A sum without over an unwrap with no parser is left out: no field of the generator's data is numeric without a parser, so every build answers an empty result. Run with the control set.",
